.TH SOLARISPKN-VERITY-TREE 1 "November 2026" "SolarisPKN" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
solarispkn-verity-tree \- Merkle tree formatting via Linux AF_ALG
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B solarispkn-verity-tree
.RI "COMMAND HASH [OPTIONS]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Experimental userspace implementation of a Merkle tree formatter and verifier.
SHA-256 may be available in the standard kernel. BLAKE3 requires a suitable
registered hash provider and is not installed by this package.
.SH COMMANDS
format, verify, selftest.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR veritysetup (8)
.SH AUTHORS
SolarisPKN contributors.
